{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00436",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.22,
      "end_seconds": 7.67,
      "duration_seconds": 6.45,
      "text": "Doctor, hello, I've got my papers here, where should I put them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.21,
      "end_seconds": 12.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "You're fine, sit down. So, what brings you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 13.12,
      "end_seconds": 18.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.18,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. I'll stay and and fill in anything that's missed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.17,
      "end_seconds": 23.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "Yes, that's no problem at all. Please sit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 25.43,
      "end_seconds": 29.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "She's been having pain in both knees, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.75,
      "end_seconds": 37.22,
      "duration_seconds": 7.47,
      "text": "And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 37.32,
      "end_seconds": 43.37,
      "duration_seconds": 6.05,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.38,
      "end_seconds": 70.0,
      "duration_seconds": 25.62,
      "text": "I was getting to to that! Well, I've also had a grinding sound when I move, for two months. I mean, as for difficulty getting up from a chair, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 71.0,
      "end_seconds": 81.52,
      "duration_seconds": 10.52,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Temperature 36.9, heart rate 81, oxygen saturation is 99 percent, respiratory rate 16, pressure 115 over 73."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.6,
      "end_seconds": 84.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.9,
      "end_seconds": 90.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "I'll examine you now, bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.47,
      "end_seconds": 95.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "A A little pressure here, tell me if it's tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.58,
      "end_seconds": 113.96,
      "duration_seconds": 6.38,
      "text": "Bending is limited to about a right angle, and it hurts at the end."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.81,
      "end_seconds": 117.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Bear with me a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.35,
      "end_seconds": 132.46,
      "duration_seconds": 7.11,
      "text": "There's mild swelling on the right knee, and a grating feel when I bend it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.47,
      "end_seconds": 146.56,
      "duration_seconds": 11.09,
      "text": "That's all I need, thank you. A few quick ones: redness over the knee, pain in other joints, fever or back pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.36,
      "end_seconds": 167.05,
      "duration_seconds": 15.69,
      "text": "No, um, no redness over the knee, no pain in other joints, no fever. I did have stiffness in the morning at one point, but that that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.9,
      "end_seconds": 171.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Did you get locking of the knee or fall?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.67,
      "end_seconds": 176.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "No, no locking of the knee or fall."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.63,
      "end_seconds": 180.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "is your urine normal, no changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.01,
      "end_seconds": 186.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "no, that's all fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.72,
      "end_seconds": 192.75,
      "duration_seconds": 5.03,
      "text": "Have you noticed any weakness, or anything odd with your balance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.73,
      "end_seconds": 195.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Nothing odd there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.33,
      "end_seconds": 197.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.57,
      "end_seconds": 203.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.61,
      "end_seconds": 207.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Before I prescribe anything, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.12,
      "end_seconds": 211.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "I've never been told I have allergies"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.52,
      "end_seconds": 226.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "are you on any tablets or medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.07,
      "end_seconds": 236.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "it's metformin, twice a day for my sugar"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.91,
      "end_seconds": 240.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "So, and what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.69,
      "end_seconds": 246.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "500 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.37,
      "end_seconds": 250.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "when did you start it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 251.24,
      "end_seconds": 257.88,
      "duration_seconds": 6.64,
      "text": "For about a month. I'm on telmisartan, 40 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 259.81,
      "end_seconds": 265.61,
      "duration_seconds": 5.8,
      "text": "That's what's prescribed, but I'm not sure she takes it every day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 267.21,
      "end_seconds": 274.22,
      "duration_seconds": 7.01,
      "text": "it's a... um, I can't remember what it's called it's a round yellow one"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.75,
      "end_seconds": 278.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "do you remember what it's for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 280.43,
      "end_seconds": 293.11,
      "duration_seconds": 12.68,
      "text": "for the joint pain, I believe my daughter sets them out for me, I just take what I'm given it's bisoprolol, 2.5 milligrams, once a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.88,
      "end_seconds": 300.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "right, anyone in the family with similar problems or other conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 301.32,
      "end_seconds": 305.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "My brother has asthma. My mother has migraines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.77,
      "end_seconds": 312.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.67,
      "text": "so, do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 314.19,
      "end_seconds": 322.56,
      "duration_seconds": 8.37,
      "text": "I've had diabetes, yes. High blood pressure, for about a year. I have arthritis in my knees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.83,
      "end_seconds": 325.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "okay, anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 326.65,
      "end_seconds": 332.33,
      "duration_seconds": 5.68,
      "text": "yes, high cholesterol my family kept telling me to get it checked"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.81,
      "end_seconds": 334.79,
      "duration_seconds": 0.98,
      "text": "Go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 336.85,
      "end_seconds": 339.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "I've had an irregular heartbeat, yes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 355.73,
      "end_seconds": 357.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 357.9,
      "end_seconds": 359.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "I've never smoked"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 360.88,
      "end_seconds": 363.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Are you living with family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 364.41,
      "end_seconds": 368.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "I stay with my daughter and her family"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 369.03,
      "end_seconds": 377.72,
      "duration_seconds": 8.69,
      "text": "just to be sure I understood you've had pain in both knees, and no fever or pain in other joints"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 378.23,
      "end_seconds": 378.93,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Exactly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 383.69,
      "end_seconds": 421.96,
      "duration_seconds": 38.27,
      "text": "we should do blood tests for joint pain. Let's book an X-ray of both knees to look into knee pain. The treatment will be paracetamol, 650 milligrams, three times a day, for two weeks. You take it by mouth. That's for knee pain. Losing even a few kilos takes a lot of load off the knees, and I'd like you to do the strengthening exercises. If the symptoms get worse, that's the point to come in urgently"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 426.58,
      "end_seconds": 430.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "Oh, alright, I know what to look for."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 431.75,
      "end_seconds": 438.64,
      "duration_seconds": 6.89,
      "text": "We'll catch up in four weeks. What are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 440.13,
      "end_seconds": 451.47,
      "duration_seconds": 11.34,
      "text": "So, I take the paracetamol, 650 milligrams, three times a day and come back in four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 457.55,
      "end_seconds": 461.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Alright, I'll see you out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 462.91,
      "end_seconds": 465.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "all good here. Thank you"
    }
  ]
}